{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1000_p", "source_sha256": "790a56cab3c67e693990511fc0c25a110d9edc6f617b7d3519e8c4fac23417ef", "ja": "（今日は、ミュージカルのリハーサル。紬は、突然\n士官学校に入れられた元平民の男の子役だが……）", "zh": "（今天是音乐剧的彩排。紬饰演的是一个突然被送进军官学校的平民男孩，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "14cfac9638656872092d119a591135df55d5253afde06336fcf4c594f0f5475c", "ja": "『もう、クララってばっ』……んんっ。\n『もう、クララってば』……。", "zh": "“真是的，克拉拉你也真是的！”……嗯哼。\n“真是的，克拉拉你也真是的”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b2ce2021c2fdedfd2c2d9a5d1281aad4196cb701c908eb2b19e27c944e2bd336", "ja": "お疲れさま、紬。芝居の確認か？\n休憩中なのに熱心だな。", "zh": "辛苦了，紬。是在确认戏剧内容吗？\n明明在休息，还真认真啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "307fc70ceab097f48292dc2c6393e5cb6ee9563363c53ee230de71f289d60896", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\nええ。もちろん、休んではおりますが……。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n嗯。当然也有在休息，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "16d5b6b49599abe16d2527397eb1507519497e952f81c6903e31e583a86c3f78", "ja": "ミュージカルは、一発勝負ですから。\nリハーサルも、その緊張感を持って臨まねば、と。", "zh": "音乐剧可是一次定胜负的演出。\n所以即使是彩排，也必须带着那种紧张感认真对待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1005_p", "source_sha256": "000393d3fa89b7b648d4c2b06fc164117def50ee6d61d2e8b3c255f5df46f357", "ja": "そうか。でもレッスンの甲斐もあって、\n難しい役なのにしっかり演じられていると思うぞ。", "zh": "这样啊。不过多亏了你的练习，\n我觉得你把这么难的角色也演绎得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cd07a5594f3eb2e1f2789a4d3df26a1b267bf6d75984124b40ff942855a68f27", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\nですが、その……難しい、とは？", "zh": "啊，谢谢您。\n不过，那个……您说的“困难”，是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a621bd461fdaed92a2aa0b02fc2a0b2e861cdc5d134ea9f17f4bd818d32af1ab", "ja": "ラファエルは、クララの好意に対して\n鈍感っていう設定だろう？", "zh": "拉斐尔对克拉拉的好意，是设定成毫无察觉的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1008_p", "source_sha256": "91455e51e019afd2c1db41988cd5f06539fb034bb97a4a859c24a017fb474dc2", "ja": "でも紬は、台本を読んで理解してしまっている。\nその上で鈍感な子を演じないといけないんだから。", "zh": "可是纺已经读过剧本，理解了这一点。既然如此，还得演一个迟钝的孩子才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e83bb6dcb819eee1d4ed068c0474c99dcfe4808bd9e8ffc6d31ec026c898ad83", "ja": "たしかに、鈍感なお芝居をすることには、\n戸惑いもありましたが……。", "zh": "确实，要演一个迟钝的人，多少还是会感到困惑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f31f35a4bc41bb8ada9b3537f83f0fa9e81bcceb47b80be17e7763f5a370de57", "ja": "ですが、幸いにも……身近に、\nよいお手本がいらっしゃるので。", "zh": "不过，幸运的是……身边就有一位很好的范本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c5baa9173862638f413169bf35c652246a0bbdc227d82fd54a1c30069db7d08f", "ja": "その方をよく観察したことで、自ずと……\n鈍感なお芝居を、掴むことができたかと。", "zh": "正因为仔细观察了那位，自然而然地……我想，我已经掌握了如何演出迟钝的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0984f2687e8807359b0c274754df479a0ad6da2fa9adf18b5cb8811310fc7442", "ja": "身近に……ん？　もしかして、\nそのお手本って俺の事か……？", "zh": "就在身边……嗯？难道那个范本指的是我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8cd13008aa7ed68c433a3473f1244c7d42d2394aa6bf81f81acc9f4a5b715320", "ja": "な、なな……！？　なんでわかっ……！\nい、いえっ！　違いますが……違いますけど！？", "zh": "不、不不……！？你、你怎么会知道……！\n不、不是！虽然……虽然确实不是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b426a728a9d7135fe66a5f360d48ed02c8aa079595b0e7a44ea3f15b727c2f0f", "ja": "ご、ご自分がお手本になるような人間だと\nお思いなら、勘違いも甚だしいですからっ！？", "zh": "如、如果您觉得自己是能成为榜样的人，那可真是大错特错了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1015_p", "source_sha256": "239753dcc1e567b2d46a61530d10ff6ff0058af18a95c71317b2eebbcf4ce300", "ja": "そ、そうか……ごめん。そうだよな、\n俺ももっとプロデューサーとして精進しないと……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……抱歉。说得也是，我作为制作人也得更加努力才行……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "62f25218b3d8751230a46fc59ce1cbd1cddaa318326dd26c501c5d332f68085f", "ja": "うぅ……なんなん……？\n何でこういう時に限って、勘が鋭くなるん……？", "zh": "呜……这是怎么回事……？\n为什么偏偏在这种时候，直觉会变得这么敏锐啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c61ebf1d59da6e78253753d3edc65fb4a84d595084a1ec0e0a5a8aec951df381", "ja": "紬、大丈夫か？　本当にごめん。\n俺が変な勘違いしたせいで……。", "zh": "紬，没事吧？真的很抱歉。都是因为我产生了奇怪的误会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "431d1910064012b015e655318ce497778c8c575ee706ff96fd13024af02c352f", "ja": "ほ、本当です！\nもう休憩も終わりだというのに……！", "zh": "真、真的！\n明明休息时间都已经结束了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0504_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1419745a84d17a82428e7b594724f987f4b0547f2889fef6e38ab79f18695e3f", "ja": "{$P$}の……だらぶち！\nい、いってまいります！", "zh": "{$P$}这个……大笨蛋！\n我、我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
